    "system": {
        "description": {
            "value": "<p>You're tied up and can barely move, or a creature has you pinned. You have the @UUID[Compendium.avant.conditionitems.Item.Off-Guard] and @UUID[Compendium.avant.conditionitems.Item.Immobilized] conditions, and you can't use any attack or manipulate actions except to attempt to @UUID[Compendium.avant.actionsavant.Item.Escape] or @UUID[Compendium.avant.actionsavant.Item.Force Open] your bonds. Restrained overrides @UUID[Compendium.avant.conditionitems.Item.Grabbed].</p>"
